# Day 8 – Personal Environmental Health Analyzer

## 🚀 ABTalks 60-Day Claude AI Mastery Challenge

### 📌 Topic
Building Interactive AI Applications with Claude Artifacts

## 🎯 Objective

Learn how Claude Artifacts can generate complete interactive HTML applications from a well-designed prompt.

## 🌍 Project

**Personal Environmental Health Analyzer**

An AI-powered interactive dashboard that analyzes environmental health data and presents insights through charts, filters, scorecards, and recommendations.

## ✨ Features

- Interactive Dashboard
- AQI Analysis
- PM2.5 & PM10 Charts
- City Ranking
- Environmental Health Score
- Air & Water Quality Report Cards
- Personalized Recommendations
- Mobile Responsive Design
- Dark Theme UI

## 🧠 What I Learned

- Claude Artifacts can generate complete HTML applications.
- Better prompts produce better dashboards.
- AI can combine data analysis, UI design, and frontend development.
- Interactive applications provide a much better user experience than plain text.

